X.TH CUBESERVER 6 "cubes 5.1" GMP "UNIX Gaming Manual"
X.SH NAME
Xcubeserver \- cubes dice game service
X.\"
X.\" sccsid: @(#)cubeserver.6 5.1 (G.M. Paris) 89/01/22
X.\"
X.\"
X.\"
X.\"	cubes 5.1  Copyright 1988 Gregory M. Paris
